{%- comment -%}
Outcome stat band. Pulls metrics already stated in a story into a scannable
mono row. One delimited param so it stays terse in markdown:

  {% include stats items="~20%|intended user flows;;5+ yrs|IA in production" %}

Split on ";;" between stats, "|" between numeral and label.
{%- endcomment -%}
<dl class="stats">
  {%- assign _items = include.items | split: ";;" -%}
  {%- for _item in _items -%}
    {%- assign _parts = _item | split: "|" -%}
    <div class="stat">
      <dt class="stat__num">{{ _parts[0] | strip }}</dt>
      <dd class="stat__label">{{ _parts[1] | strip }}</dd>
    </div>
  {%- endfor -%}
</dl>
